      <a href="#a-worked-example">2. A worked example</a>
      <a href="#what-changed-in-2026-the-25d-expiration">3. What changed in 2026: the 25D expiration</a>
      <a href="#why-nem-is-the-variable-that-matters-most">4. Why NEM is the variable that matters most</a>
      <a href="#adding-a-battery-when-it-helps-and-when-it-doesnt">5. Adding a battery — when it helps and when it doesnt</a>
      <a href="#cash-vs-loan-financing">6. Cash vs loan financing</a>
      <a href="#what-inverter-replacement-actually-costs">7. What inverter replacement actually costs</a>
      <a href="#what-doesnt-matter-as-much-as-you-think">8. What doesnt matter as much as you think</a>
      <a href="#related-guides" class="border-brand-300 bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-100 hover:text-brand-700">Related &amp; calculator &rarr;</a>
